{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Practical habit frameworks and coaching to restore energy, sleep, and daily balance in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="theme-earthy">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-grid">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="{{COACH_NAME}} avatar" class="brand-avatar">
        <div>
          <div class="brand-name">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="brand-tag">{{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Paths</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="btn small">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="hero" class="hero container">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="eyebrow">Science-backed coaching for steady change</h1>
          <h2 class="hero-title">Rebuild sustainable habits, not quick fixes</h2>
          <p class="lead">Work with {{COACH_NAME}} to create small, measurable routines that improve energy, mood, and focus — guided by practical frameworks and data-driven check-ins.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="#pillars">See the approach</a>
          </div>
          <form id="lead-form" class="lead-form" aria-label="Download guide">
            <label for="email">Free guide: 5 habit shifts that yield measurable improvements</label>
            <div class="form-row">
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Get the guide</button>
            </div>
            <small class="meta">No spam; actionable checklist you can try this week.</small>
          </form>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="Warm organic illustration" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="myth_vs_truth" class="myth-truth container">
      <div class="section-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Common myths</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Myth: Willpower alone changes habits.</li>
            <li>Myth: One-size-fits-all plans are best.</li>
            <li>Myth: Fast results equal lasting change.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-contrast">
          <h3>What the evidence shows</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>True: Small, consistent tweaks beat occasional intensity.</li>
            <li>True: Personalized contexts and cues predict adherence.</li>
            <li>True: Measurement + iteration produces durable gains.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pillars" class="pillars container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2>Three practical pillars I use with clients</h2>
        <p class="kicker">Each pillar is a repeatable practice you can adopt today.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="pillars-grid">
        <article class="pillar">
          <img src="assets/img/pattern.svg" alt="pattern" class="pillar-visual">
          <h4>Anchor Routines</h4>
          <p>Use existing daily anchors (like morning coffee) to attach one new micro-habit and track it for 21 days.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="pillar">
          <img src="assets/img/pattern.svg" alt="pattern" class="pillar-visual">
          <h4>Signal-Response Loops</h4>
          <p>We map predictable cues and design immediate, low-friction responses so healthy behavior becomes automatic.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="pillar">
          <img src="assets/img/pattern.svg" alt="pattern" class="pillar-visual">
          <h4>Measurement & Micro-Adjustments</h4>
          <p>Weekly micro-metrics reveal which changes are working; we iterate to reduce burden and increase wins.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="case_studies" class="case-studies container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2>Outcome stories</h2>
        <p class="kicker">Real patterns, measurable improvements — anonymized and focused on habits.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="cases-grid">
        <article class="case">
          <h4>From fragmented sleep to consistent rest</h4>
          <p class="meta">Client: 34, remote work — 10-week program</p>
          <p>By shifting bedtime cues and introducing a 7-minute pre-sleep routine, average nightly sleep increased by 48 minutes and daytime focus improved.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="case">
          <h4>Energy stabilization for early afternoons</h4>
          <p class="meta">Client: 42, hybrid schedule — 8-week program</p>
          <p>A simple meal-timing experiment and a 3-minute mid-day movement cue reduced afternoon energy dips in 6 of 8 weeks.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="case">
          <h4>Sustainable movement habit</h4>
          <p class="meta">Client: 27, student — 12-week program</p>
          <p>Starting with 5-minute daily blocks and progressive variability led to a 4x increase in weekly active days.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="faq container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h2>Questions I often get</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="faq-grid">
        <div class="qa">
          <button class="q">How quickly will I see results?</button>
          <div class="a">Small wins can appear in the first 2–3 weeks; durable change usually requires consistent practice over 8–12 weeks.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <button class="q">Do you make medical recommendations?</button>
          <div class="a">I focus on behavioral frameworks and lifestyle patterns; I do not provide medical diagnoses. I collaborate with healthcare providers when needed.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="qa">
          <button class="q">What do sessions include?</button>
          <div class="a">Assessment, one prioritized habit to test, a data-friendly tracking plan, and a short written follow-up with adjustments.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="cta container">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <div>
          <h2>Ready to try a science-first approach?</h2>
          <p>Join a short exploratory call to map one change you can test this week.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class="btn primary large" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <p class="contact">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        <p>{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      </div>
      <nav class="footer-nav">
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="small">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
